				<title>The resurrection</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5127</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP 5127&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object class:&lt;/strong&gt; Safe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containbment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
SCP 5127 is to be kept in glass box in 4m*2m*3m room made out of titanium and monitored 24/7. If personal tries to resurrect deceased body for 2nd time they are to be&lt;br /&gt;
stopped before the proccess of resurrection is completed. If SCP 5127-2 enters the body it is to be incinerated immediately.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
SCP 5127 was discovered in Chaco, Argentina in 2003 after civilians were consistently reporting deceased people rising from their graves. SCP 5127 consists of SCP 5127-1&lt;br /&gt;
and SCP 5127-2. SCP 5127-1 is strangely shaped book with covers made of unknown harmful white substance and pages made out of leather which appears to have ability to&lt;br /&gt;
resurrect deceased people. Proccess of SCP 5127-1 resurrecting people consists of user bringing deceased human within 2 meters to SCP 5127-1 and writing deceased humans&lt;br /&gt;
name. People resurrected (now labeled as SCP 5127-3) do not appear to be hostile towards personal and seem to have trouble controlling their body.&lt;br /&gt;
SCP 5127-3 has full memory of its past. SCP 5127-3 also seems to be in better condition than they were in before their death. It is more intelligent and stronger.&lt;br /&gt;
SCP 5127-3 will be alive for certain period of time. Time for how long SCP 5127-3 will be alive for isn&#039;t determined since some instances of SCP 5127-3 died within&lt;br /&gt;
period of 1 hour while some instances of SCP 5127-3 are still alive years after being ressurected. SCP 5127-3 can be resurrected only once. If user tries resurrecting&lt;br /&gt;
same person twice the person trying to be ressurected will become possesed by SCP 5127-2. SCP 5127-2 is shapeless black entity which comes out of SCP 5127-1 when its triggered.&lt;br /&gt;
SCP 5127-2 gets triggered every time the user tries to resurrect same deceased human twice. After possesing the body the human body will regenerate it self and grow 2 meters taller&lt;br /&gt;
than its original form, the skin will be peeled off and muscle tissues will get black pigment. SCP 5127-2 will afterwords roam around the accessable areas slaughtering&lt;br /&gt;
everything in its pheripheral vision. SCP 5127-2 posseses incredible strength and resistence to bullets. Once the period between 6-7 hours passes or SCP 5127-2 is taken&lt;br /&gt;
down it will leave the deceased person&#039;s body and go back in SCP 5127-1.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notes:&lt;/strong&gt; Following event of ████████ SCP 5127-2 will now attempt to posses bodies which are being resurrected for 1st time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/velja-vraccarevicc&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6524034&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1605816129&quot; alt=&quot;Velja Vraccarevicc&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6524034)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/velja-vraccarevicc&quot;  &gt;Velja Vraccarevicc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
