				<title>SCP-5156</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5156</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5156&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Euclid, Potential Keter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5156 is to be kept at a 16x16 white room exactly 3 feet above the ground and 4 bulletproof glasses, 1 for each corner (This helps said SCP stay sane by seeing employees through glass). With a gas pipe filled with nerve gas for control usage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5156 is a mutated virus that came from an unknown planet. It&#039;s appearance is a genderless Humanoid-shaped figure that has arms twirling uncontrollably every second for an odd reason. SCP-5156&#039;s capabilities are yet to be understood, but the one discovered is regeneration. SCP-5156&#039;s regeneration from wounds and such is absurd, it has come to a point where SCP-5156 can regenerate a limb for approximately 3 seconds. Sightings of SCP-5156 have been spotted in ██████. Thankfully, only a handful of people saw it. Further research of SCP-5156 is ordered by the 05 Council. Reports and Investigation will be available to those of Level 4+ Clearance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Investigations:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5156-investigation-001&quot;&gt;SCP-5156 Investigation 001&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research Logs:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5156-research-log-001&quot;&gt;SCP-5156 Research Log 001&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alexei-molkov&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7031295&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1605816132&quot; alt=&quot;Alexei Molkov&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7031295)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alexei-molkov&quot;  &gt;Alexei Molkov&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
