&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-385626-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. A rival cheesesteak shop across the street from Geno&#039;s Steaks.&lt;/div&gt;
